# terminal-only/uu-canvas-watchdog.service — 画布看门狗（由 uu-canvas-watchdog.timer 周期触发）
# BUG-001(2026-10-13) 后续：链路自检 + 画布重启感知，失败以非零码退出供 journal 高亮。
[Unit]
Description=UU terminal-only canvas watchdog (link self-check + canvas restart detection)
